{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301310","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130131001:1":{"text":"誰って……タリンタさんって名前の商人だよ。","source_cn":"谁？……不是塔林塔先生啊。我在等一位叫做塔林塔的商人——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0641391E6253109F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130131002:1":{"text":"彼らの商隊が荒涼の砂漠まで行商に来ようとしてて、タリンタさんは先に道を調べに来てるんだ。","source_cn":"他们商队来到荒角沙漠行商，塔林塔先生先来探路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE32E7264F20D4062","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130131003:1":{"text":"ここで休めるってわかって、商隊に知らせようと戻ったんだ。","source_cn":"他发现了我们这里可以休整，于是回去通知商队了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD21B4708E3C3C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130131004:1":{"text":"タリンタさんはここに貨物をたくさん置いていって、俺に見張りを頼んだのさ。","source_cn":"他还在我这里存放了不少的货物，拜托我照看好。在他回来前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D4BEAA5682A6636","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血法尔西":{"text":"ババリアのファルシー","source":"小蛮血法尔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}